<title>USA: West Noble School, Ind., 5.00 pct top yld in 2005.</title>
<headline>West Noble School, Ind., 5.00 pct top yld in 2005.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets Inc said Tuesday it tentatively priced $4.2 million of West Noble School Building Corporation Ligonier, Ind., first mortgage refunding, Series 1996, bank qualified bonds, with a top yield of 5.00 percent in 2005.  </p>
<p>RE: $4,205,000*</p>
<p>LIGONIER, INDIANA</p>
<p>FIRST MORTGAGE REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>BANK QUALIFIED</p>
<p>MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: A</p>
<p>DATED: 09/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01 &amp; 07/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
